        // ------------------------------------------------------------------ what the research says
        Lesson("e-onesec", Topic.EVIDENCE, "A short pause changes a lot",
            "The app one sec adds a brief breathing pause before chosen apps. In its own data, people gave up on about a third of their attempts to open them, and over six weeks opened them 57% less often. That part had no comparison group and counted openings, not minutes, and the effect faded a little as people got used to it. In a separate experiment, the part that mattered most was simply an easy way to cancel; a reflective message on its own did little.",
            "When Intent's pause appears, let 'Not now' be the default answer.",
