        Lesson("e-30min", Topic.EVIDENCE, "About 30 minutes of social media a day",
            "Students who limited Facebook, Instagram and Snapchat to 10 minutes each per day for three weeks became significantly less lonely and depressed than a group who used them as usual, especially those who started out more depressed.",
